   "narrow_reading_ruling": "adopted: disjunction is a claim-statement property (second-class mention or merged C0/C2 formulation), implemented and tested in S-E; ledger class_ids arity is governed by the builder contract, not by HF-02",
   "rubric_tension": "the HF-02 phrase itself says 'class_ids' (plural), so this ruling rests on the metric definition, the canonical implementation, and the builder contract - not on the phrase alone. A one-line rubric clarification would remove the ambiguity; that is a documentation change, not a ledger repair."
